# docs/ is rendered by `just docs` / CI (shipyard build-docs); only the
# hand-authored pages negated below are tracked. An enumerated list of generated
# filenames drifts every time shipyard adds one, so this ignores the directory
# and allowlists the exceptions instead.
docs/*
!docs/README.md
!docs/_sidebar.md
!docs/favicon.svg

__pycache__
.DS_Store

# Scratch from the initial build session.
initial-build.md
NOTES.md
